Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the way. I'm afraid of it. But
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The time. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of it. I'm not afraid of it. It's time to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of it. I'm afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm afraid of it\Nas if I'm afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one, break the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può sfuggire dal destino scelto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman solo il risultato\Nche voi sarete distrutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The regulations get mad, going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,gemacht from the world. No, we\Ndon't turn the power. We'rejdng!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, lecture Melone, do the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it shaped like Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that damn sculptor\NI keep hearing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't screw\Naround when you're at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky my orders\Nwant to kill you outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, now that I\Nsee you're a stand user,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm not\Ntempted to just put one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,between your eyes and get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing is, I still gotta\Nfind out who the hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come back to the matter\Nof your girlfriend's fall later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know, Bucciarati,\Nand why did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, are you a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the case,\Nthey would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy with the gun gets\Nto ask the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So play along if you don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't try anything funny, because\NI'm seriously not in the mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:03:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word that comes out of your\Nmouth better be 100 % true, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll ask you\None question at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a mafioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if you belong to a\Nsyndicate, tell me which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, I can find\Nout later if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm little more than a regular sculptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hardly well known, but\NI make enough to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain how you became a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't know what\Nany of those words even mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're referring to this power,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it just sort of appeared\None day when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it the same for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a lot more to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you follow me\Nall the way from the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And how does some randu like\Nyou know who Bucciarati is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that happen to be his name by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't answered any of my\Nquestions, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're not going\Nto like what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The rock has its own independent will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been that\Nway, as far as I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's nothing\NI can do to rein it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you are not the person it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the rock is\Nseeking out Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look stupid to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get serious about\Nthis right freaking now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,unless you never want to\Npick up a chisel ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Bucciarati's nowhere near this\Nplace, so quit trying to fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,because I can hurt you a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one fooling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is without a\Ndoubt inside this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm begging\Nyou to let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His life is in grave danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say about lying to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't test my patience, you murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I should end you for killing that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Nplotting now, asshole?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Which part of Don't Try Anything\NFunny wasn't clear to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's left...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It wants nothing from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to share some art history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sculptor Michelangelo once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I approach the marble with chisel in\Nhand, but with no thought in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For the stone already knows well\Nthe form it is destined to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And to that end,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,my hands are tools, made simply to\Ndeliver the medium, but never shape it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Laurie, that's enough, you goddamn nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to bring that\Nstupid rock back here right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll shoot you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A sculpture's ultimate form is not given.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Michelangelo would conject.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The sculptor's only job was to\Nunearth what fate had already created.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He could see fate's design growing\Nclearer with each strike of his chisel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not give the stone\NBucciarati's shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither did your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was solely fate's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you saw the massive\Nchest wound and gush of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it will be in days or\Nmonths, none can really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is the way in which\NBucciarati will meet his end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are nothing\Nmore than slaves to fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the significance behind my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Prophecy Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last warning I'll give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring that damn rock back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if your dumbass eats it,\Nthen so does your little Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If he touches my Prophecy Stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise he'll be granted a\Nmerciful release with no suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, I only wish\Nto hear his last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy's deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he mocking me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard hasn't flinched\Nonce this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you seriously want me to spray the\Nplace with your insides, then wish granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.77,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I got three whole bullets\Nwhile you just have one brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at what\Nfate buried in your mushy ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're trying to do something\Nweird to Bucciarati, so stop playing dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your freaking rock back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, friend, you really don't want\Nto test how much time you got left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, at this point there's\Nnot a single thing more to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the bullshit act and bring\Nthe rock back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The florist who sent you, his\Nlegs were no good, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's an early symptom of some\Norgan disease, one he won't overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after the daughter passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,her healthy organs were\Npreserved for transplantation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and will eventually save the man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor girl found out about\Nher father's ailment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,from the rock and learned\Nthat in a few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,she'd contract the disease too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a revelation she accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She chose death to save her father\Nand to avoid suffering later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why\Nshe embraced the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She was freed from the dark\Nfate awaiting her and granted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,a merciful death which would\Nleave all her organs intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty messed up way of saying\Nyou killed an innocent girl, psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a misfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that bullet was a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that bullet was supposed to be\Nstupid number five's responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My death still hasn't found\Nits form in the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really think I'm going\Nto shoot two blanks in a row,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then you've lost your tiny little mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What you felt just now\Nwas destiny nudging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost any real desire\Nto shoot me, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me\Nwith all this Destiny bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way any of that\Nmade-up nonsense is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's just nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Fugo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some news on our sculptor friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, the guy's\Na stand user. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the weirdo won't shut up about\NBucciarati and Destiny and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make sense of anything\Nhe's been babbling about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say the same about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Bucciarati there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He got out of the car right after you and\Nheaded straight to the apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure he would have\Ncaught up with you at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you remember what the number\Nto Bucciarati's phone was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really important that I\Nget to him right the hell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey breathe the phone you're\Ncalling is Bucciarati's you moron
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Mista, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you guys\Nfind Bucciarati quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, princess. Nap time's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how to stop this damn\Nrock from killing my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wake up you answer me\Nright freaking now Tell me exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,what I gotta do to stop that dumb pebble\Nof yours from reaching Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me save my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I think I'm starting to\Nget all that stuff you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but you gotta tell me how\Nto turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is not touching that rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, what's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you do not resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Acceptance is the easier path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if you're set on defying\Nthe rock, there might be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can destroy it or reshape\Nit somehow, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We got eyes on Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A report came in from Number\NOne confirming it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is somewhere\Non the seventh floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the stairwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's climbing the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It beat us to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it together, Number One!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on getting there\Nand tell him not to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Number One's bullet doesn't\Nhave nearly enough juice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,left in it to get him all\Nthe way there in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Six bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like we did to the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's cool that we've\Ngot it crumbling and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think we might have just\Nmade stuff a whole lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bullets, why don't you fill\Nme in on what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we dealing with a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And can any of you explain why\Nthe hell it looks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Mujirachi, get away from it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipperman, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't go, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you touch it, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down from there, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, trust me, you're not gonna\Nwanna lay a finger on that rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One small tap and it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do that as soon\Nas we get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that stone mass supposed to be a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop asking me all these questions\Nand run away for your life already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's slipping away again,\Njust like in the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that thing could\Nattack at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find another way to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This stairwell just turned\Ninto a goddamn death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay on our toes\Nand climb out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that slippery little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what is it you've learned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this rock bear that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to destroy the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least try to\Nchange its shape somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I smash it into the\Npavement from this high,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that should be enough to\Nshatter its ass to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, he was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,after all everything went just as he said
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you don't\Nsee your own mug carved
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,inside the stone you get\Nto live on for at least
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,another day nice what\Nthe hell were you doing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in there mister you left\Nthe recorder in the car
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,after your tantrum, doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So what on earth were you in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, I'd very much like the\Nexplanation you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, none of it matters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know where to\Nbegin, even. Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the old man's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boyfriend, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But technically, it also wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's not leaving the\Nhospital for at least a few months, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhelpfully vague as ever. Classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do we kick his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, was it suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you start from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But see, that's the thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,piece this whole thing together\Nin a way that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all you need to know is that\NI destroyed the mean old rock stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so everything's peachy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, how's about you let me take\Nover the whole leaky eye Luca thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks, I've decided to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reporting skills would slow things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I'll do just fine on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, our florist friend\Nshould get a detailed account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather what you can from Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you know you\Nhave my utmost respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this guy here, he's a\Npuzzle even I can't solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to use Abakio's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So naive, do you really\Nbelieve this is the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you had accepted\Nthe stone's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All would be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you chose to remain enslaved to fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That which is carved in\Nstone cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A perilous journey of hardship awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And for some of you, it\Nwill be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, are all of you like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That young man flung\Nhimself off a tall building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All for a chance to save his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the path you are bound to walk\Nisn't one of meaningless suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The adversity you'll endure may well\Nbe the crucible of hope for another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And perhaps it could be the\Nbirth of a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishing for their safety will do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only hope that\Nthey are sleeping slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping slaves will eventually awaken to\Ndiscover some meaning in their suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the hold up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to heal Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why didn't I just\Nrub my gun on his wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, you gotta watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something really weird just popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did that girl go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right there behind you. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's alright. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing I tripped on\Nwas next to the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go leaving me behind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I gave you all a fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll still take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long way for a lone turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If our souls were switched back to normal,\Ndoesn't that mean yours should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My original body has perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But the moment my spirit\Ndeparted my flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure to hang on as tight\Nas I could to this turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remain bound to this key for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't mind little\Nold spectral me tagging along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, I'll admit I'm glad to\Nsee you're still kicking and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but the day's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need to patch\Nout Bucciarati's injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought his soul was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking maybe\Nyou might have had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My pits, they actually do smell like ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm just\Nnow learning about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should put on clone after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I might have exaggerated\Na little bit earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything happens so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I don't think\Nyou smell that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In a super weird kind of way,\Nit actually feels nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but your fingers are freakish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what's your choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When those who've left us\Nplace their wills in our hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it is our sacred duty to carry it forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep the\Narrow in the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll do, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A worthy decision to fulfill\Nyour duty as a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go to the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They have the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the passion. But they dare\Nto tell us what's bad and what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say this a lot. We are\Nthe power who sees the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters.\NShe's falling for a ride.
